      "id": "echomimic-v3",
      "kind": "video",
      "name": "EchoMimicV3 Flash",
      "description": "1.3B audio-driven human animation: one reference image plus a speech clip becomes a talking, gesturing video (up to ~5 s per run at 25 fps). The Flash release — 8 steps, no face mask needed. Runs through pepper's Python backend on CUDA or Apple Silicon; Apache-2.0.",
